        // NOT live component status — writing a tweak flips a component to Tweaks
        // Needed, but the card must STAY in "Waiting" so he can keep layering
        // decisions; it moves to "Tweaks pending" only when he explicitly
        // finishes, and returns to "Waiting" on a fresh ask (see _kasperIsFinished).
        // The Urgent bucket is a SPLIT OF WAITING, not a fourth kind of card:
        // an urgent card is a waiting card someone has pinged him about, and it
        // behaves like every other waiting card in every other respect (same
        // render, same actions, same finish path). Splitting here rather than
        // anywhere downstream is what keeps that true -- nothing else in the
        // review tab has to learn the word "urgent".
